Voyager Research Archive
========================

The DERIVED analysis and project structure in this repository are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0). The full licence text is at:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

In summary:
- You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose,
  including commercially.
- You must give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate
  if changes were made.

The PRIMARY SOURCE materials in primary-sources/ retain the licence
status of their originating institution. Each subdirectory's README
documents the specific licence/use status of the materials it
contains. Most are public-domain US Government works, conference
presentations distributed for research use, or items that have been
previously published with the originating institution's consent.

Our DERIVED work that wraps or interprets the primary sources is
licensed CC BY 4.0 in the spirit of furthering open scholarship on a
historical engineering artifact.
